exports[`golden requests: what each provider is sent > 1 plain chat, no tools · claude 1`] = `
{
  "provider": "claude",
  "requests": [
    {
      "options": {
        "signal": "[AbortSignal]",
      },
      "params": {
        "max_tokens": 64000,
        "messages": [
          {
            "content": "Explain the difference between revenue and profit in two sentences.",
            "role": "user",
          },
        ],
        "model": "fake-sonnet",
        "output_config": {
          "effort": "medium",
        },
        "system": [
          {
            "cache_control": {
              "type": "ephemeral",
            },
            "text": "<text ccbedb05b9a22907 (24485 chars)>",
            "type": "text",
          },
          {
            "text": "The current date is <date> (time zone UTC).

<arcNave_capabilities>

ArcNave provides a small set of powerful tools.

The chat renders Markdown, \`$$…$$\` math with KaTeX, and \`\`\`mermaid\`\`\` diagrams.

Available core tool families include:

Tool schemas supplied by the runtime are authoritative.

Do not guess tool parameters from this prompt.

</arcNave_capabilities>",
            "type": "text",
          },
        ],
        "thinking": {
          "display": "summarized",
          "type": "adaptive",
        },
      },
    },
  ],
}
`;

