                "source": {
                  "data": "<text 30e30c9f55b90a3c (120788 chars)>",
                  "media_type": "image/jpeg",
                  "type": "base64",
                },
                "type": "image",
              },
              {
                "text": "Text of page 2:
Carry forward: up to 30 days.",
                "type": "text",
              },
              {
                "text": "<available_attachments>
Available conversation attachments:
- fileId: "<uuid-1>" | filename: "policy.pdf" | type: application/pdf | size: 1358 bytes | path: input/policy.pdf | in your context: 2 page images, a text layer on 2 of 2

Use fileId when filenames are ambiguous.
Every file above is also on the computer at its path, read-only. A file in your context is already read: use the computer to change that file or to build a new one, not to read it again.
</available_attachments>

How many earned leave days does the policy give?",
                "type": "text",
              },
            ],
            "role": "user",
          },
