    {
      "description": "Shows a list of places, each with photos and a short description. Use it when the answer is a set of 2 to 8 specific places to visit (cafes, hikes, neighbourhoods, hotels) and photos help ("good ramen spots in Shibuya", "best beaches near Lisbon"). Only for places you found by web search or already know.

Do not use it for a day-by-day plan (itinerary_display_v0) or a single place (write it in text).

Pass each place's name and description; photos are added from the names, so never pass image URLs. A description can run to a paragraph: what it is like, what to order or do, when to go. Do not list the places again in your text.",
