    {
      "description": "Shows a day-by-day trip with a tab per day and the stops of each day. Use it for trip planning where the answer is an ordered schedule over one or more days, each with at least one named stop ("3 days in Lisbon", "plan a weekend in Kyoto").

Do not use it for a single place or a flat list of places with no days (places_list_display_v0); for more than 7 days or more than 12 stops in a day (summarise in text); for general travel advice (visas, packing, budget); or when the stops have no meaningful order.

Keep each blurb to one short line and day labels under about 12 characters. Do not list the itinerary again in your text.",
      "name": "itinerary_display_v0",
      "parametersJsonSchema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
