    {
      "description": "Shows 2 or 3 products side by side, with attribute rows lined up. Use it for shopping questions weighing a few named options on the same criteria ("iPad Air vs iPad Pro", "compare these three monitors").

Do not use it for one product (featured_card_display_v0) or more than three (product_carousel_display_v0); when the options share no comparable attributes; when the user wants one recommendation with reasoning; or for approaches or plans rather than things to buy.

Use the same attribute labels in the same order for every product so the rows line up. Do not repeat the products or values in your text.",
      "input_schema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "products": {
            "items": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "attributes": {
                  "items": {
                    "additionalProperties": false,
                    "properties": {
                      "label": {
                        "description": "Short attribute name ('Display', 'Battery'). The same labels, in the same order, for every product.",
                        "type": "string",
                      },
                      "value": {
                        "description": "This product's value for the attribute.",
                        "type": "string",
                      },
                    },
                    "required": [
                      "label",
                      "value",
                    ],
                    "type": "object",
                  },
                  "maxItems": 8,
                  "minItems": 2,
                  "type": "array",
                },
                "name": {
                  "description": "Product or option name (a few words).",
                  "type": "string",
                },
                "price": {
                  "description": "Display price with currency, e.g. '$1,099'. Omit when not applicable or unknown.",
                  "type": "string",
                },
                "url": {
                  "description": "Absolute https URL of the product page. Omit when you do not have a real one; never make one up.",
                  "type": "string",
                },
              },
              "required": [
                "name",
                "attributes",
              ],
              "type": "object",
            },
            "maxItems": 3,
            "minItems": 2,
            "type": "array",
          },
          "summary": {
            "description": "One short sentence (under 15 words) naming what the card shows, read when the card cannot be drawn. Do not repeat the card's values. Write it last.",
            "type": "string",
          },
        },
        "required": [
          "products",
          "summary",
        ],
        "type": "object",
      },
      "name": "comparison_card_display_v0",
    },
    {
      "description": "Shows your single best product pick as one rich card: name, optional price, and why it is the pick. Use it for shopping questions with one clear answer ("the best entry-level espresso machine", "just tell me which one to get").

Do not use it when the user wants several to browse (product_carousel_display_v0), is weighing named options on shared criteria (comparison_card_display_v0), or when the blurb would only restate the name or it is not something to buy.

The blurb can run to a paragraph: why this is the pick and its trade-offs. Do not describe the product again in your text. Photos are added for you: never pass image URLs.",
      "input_schema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "products": {
            "items": {
              "additionalProperties": false,
              "properties": {
                "blurb": {
                  "description": "Up to a paragraph on why it fits and its trade-offs. Do not restate the name or price.",
                  "type": "string",
                },
                "name": {
                  "description": "Product name (a few words).",
