    {
      "description": "Lexical keyword search over the current project's indexed files. Returns the most relevant excerpts, not whole documents, ranked by BM25 term overlap — this is keyword matching, not semantic or conceptual search, so exact terms matter more than phrasing. Use it when the question likely depends on project-specific content that hasn't already appeared in this conversation. Do not use it for general-knowledge questions unrelated to the project.",
